  "description": "Build or update framework-native, token-backed Storybook foundations, shared UI components, and stories from an extracted design-system package. Use after design-system-extractor, or when Codex must adapt design-system Markdown, tokens, and traced Figma/image/code/route evidence to an existing or new React, Vue, Angular, Svelte, Web Components, meta-framework, monorepo, or other frontend target; select the correct app root, renderer, builder, file conventions, and optional tooling; infer component dependency order; sync component documentation; plan batches; or bootstrap Storybook without silently imposing React/Vite or migrating the product framework. Also use when updating, version-checking, or explaining this skill's bundled tools: the Figma export addon and the Storybook Code To Design Figma importer.",
